{"at": "2026-10-31T06:24:20.429988+00:00", "event_id": "01M68A2TYE9TRSQ1C8M42P4BY4", "event_type": "DecisionPointOpened", "payload": {"actor_id": "cli", "actor_type": "human", "decision_point_id": "01M68A2TYC1VMDPCJ8B76602YH", "input_key": "tension_representation", "mission_id": "01M68A0TEXMSGNRTQSR1X9C7ZE", "mission_slug": "drg-tension-and-node-fields-01M68A0T", "mission_type": "software-dev", "options": ["A kernel Tension value held beside the structural relationships in DoctrineGraph (no RelationType, no HTTP contract change)", "A new RelationType constant (grows Relation and the Relation.yaml enum; /relationships accepts and answers it: HTTP contract change, operator decision)", "Other"], "origin_flow": "specify", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "phase": "SPECIFY", "question": "How is an ADR-0028 tension relationship held in the domain so that a shard's in_tension_with edge reads and writes back as written?", "recorded_at": "2026-10-31T06:24:20.429988Z", "run_id": "01M68A2TYC1VMDPCJ8B76602YH", "state_entered_at": "2026-10-31T06:24:20.428328Z", "step_id": "specify.domain.tension-representation"}}
{"at": "2026-10-31T06:24:33.004818+00:00", "event_id": "01M68A377CFJXWKG0JCF717Y9R", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M68A2TYC1VMDPCJ8B76602YH", "final_answer": "A kernel Tension value held beside the structural relationships in DoctrineGraph (no RelationType, no HTTP contract change). Rationale: ADR-0028 D3 counts tension apart from the one-structural-relationship-per-pair identity, so it is not a Relationship of another type; it keeps RelationType, Relation and the Relation.yaml enum unchanged and /relationships neither accepts nor answers a new token (the brief reserves an HTTP contract change for the operator). The pack spelling in_tension_with stays a storage concern (ADR-0036 D4). Recorded by the mission agent under the brief's 'stop only at genuine decisions' rule; logged as an open review item for operator confirmation in the PR.", "mission_id": "01M68A0TEXMSGNRTQSR1X9C7ZE", "mission_slug": "drg-tension-and-node-fields-01M68A0T", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-10-31T06:24:33.004818Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M68A2TYC1VMDPCJ8B76602YH", "state_entered_at": "2026-10-31T06:24:33.002779Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
